>Wang</surname><given-names>XH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Clinical trials of artemisinin and its derivatives in the treatment of malaria in China</article-title><source>Trans R Soc Trop Med Hyg</source><year>1994</year><volume>88</volume><fpage>S5</fpage><lpage>6</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8053027</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/0035-9203(94)90460-X</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hien</surname><given-names>TT</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>An overview of the clinical use of artemisinin and its derivatives in the treatment of falciparum malaria in Viet Nam</article-title><source>Trans R Soc Trop Med Hyg</source><year>1994</year><volume>88</volume><fpage>S7</fpage><lpage>S8</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8053033</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/0035-9203(94)90461-8</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>WHO</collab></person-group><source>Guidelines for the Treatment of Malaria</source><year>2006</year><publisher-name>World Health Organization, Geneva</publisher-name><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.who.int/malaria/treatmentguidelines.html"/></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Yeka</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Dorsey</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Kamya</surname><given-names>MR</given-names></name><name><surname>Talisuna</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Lugemwa</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Rwakimari</surname><given-names>JB</given-names></name><name><surname>Staedke</surname><given-names>SG</given-names></name><name><surname>Rosenthal</surname><given-names>PJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Wabwire-Mangen</